#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:255
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`bdb`"
msgstr "`bdb`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:258
#, fuzzy
msgid "Possible arguments: (none), `5` (default), `18`"
msgstr "可用参数：（无）、`5`（默认）、`18`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:266
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Add dependency on the Berkeley DB library.  Default to package:databases/"
"db5[].  It can also depend on package:databases/db18[] when using the `:18` "
"argument.  It is possible to declare a range of acceptable values, `:5+` "
"finds the highest installed version, and falls back to 5 if nothing else is "
"installed.  `INVALID_BDB_VER` can be used to specify versions which do not "
"work with this port.  The framework exposes the following variables to the "
"port:"
msgstr "添加对 Berkeley DB 库的依赖。默认使用 package:databases/db5[]。使用 `:18` 参数时，也可以依赖 package:databases/db18[]。可以声明可接受的版本范围：`:5+` 会查找已安装的最高版本；如果未安装其他版本，则回退到 5。可以使用 `INVALID_BDB_VER` 指定与此 Port 不兼容的版本。框架向 Port 提供以下变量："

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:267
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`BDB_LIB_NAME`"
msgstr "`BDB_LIB_NAME`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:270
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The name of the Berkeley DB library.  For example, when using package:"
"databases/db5[], it contains `db-5.3`."
msgstr "Berkeley DB 库的名称。例如，使用 package:databases/db5[] 时，其值为 `db-5.3`。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:271
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`BDB_LIB_CXX_NAME`"
msgstr "`BDB_LIB_CXX_NAME`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:274
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The name of the Berkeley DBC++ library.  For example, when using package:"
"databases/db5[], it contains `db_cxx-5.3`."
msgstr "Berkeley DBC++ 库的名称。例如，使用 package:databases/db5[] 时，其值为 `db_cxx-5.3`。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:275
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`BDB_INCLUDE_DIR`"
msgstr "`BDB_INCLUDE_DIR`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:278
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The location of the Berkeley DB include directory.  For example, when using "
"package:databases/db5[], it will contain `${LOCALBASE}/include/db5`."
msgstr "Berkeley DB include 目录的位置。例如，使用 package:databases/db5[] 时，其值为 `${LOCALBASE}/include/db5`。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:279
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`BDB_LIB_DIR`"
msgstr "`BDB_LIB_DIR`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:282
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The location of the Berkeley DB library directory.  For example, when using "
"package:databases/db5[], it contains `${LOCALBASE}/lib`."
msgstr "Berkeley DB 库目录的位置。例如，使用 package:databases/db5[] 时，其中包含 `${LOCALBASE}/lib`。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:283
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`BDB_VER`"
msgstr "`BDB_VER`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:286
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The detected Berkeley DB version.  For example, if using `USES=bdb:5+` and "
"Berkeley DB 18 is installed, it contains `18`."
msgstr "检测到的 Berkeley DB 版本。例如，使用 `USES=bdb:5+` 且已安装 Berkeley DB 18 时，其中包含 `18`。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:291
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"package:databases/db48[] is deprecated and unsupported.  It must not be used "
"by any port."
msgstr "package:databases/db48[] 已弃用且不受支持。任何 port 都不得使用它。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:294
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`bison`"
msgstr "`bison`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:297
#, fuzzy
msgid "Possible arguments: (none), `build`, `run`, `both`"
msgstr "可能的参数：（无）、`build`、`run`、`both`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:299
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Uses package:devel/bison[] By default, with no arguments or with the `build` "
"argument, it implies `bison` is a build-time dependency, `run` implies a run-"
