msgstr "如果指定了 `tkbuild` 参数，则会将 package:x11-toolkits/ocaml-labltk[] 添加到 `BUILD_DEPENDS`、`EXTRACT` 和 `PATCH_DEPENDS`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2036
