#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`USE_PHP`"
msgstr "`USE_PHP`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2190
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The list of required PHP extensions at run-time.  Add `:build` to the "
