#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2593
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`shebangfix`"
msgstr "`shebangfix`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2599
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A lot of software uses incorrect locations for script interpreters, most "
"notably [.filename]#/usr/bin/perl# and [.filename]#/bin/bash#.  The "
"shebangfix macro fixes shebang lines in scripts listed in `SHEBANG_REGEX`, "
"`SHEBANG_GLOB`, or `SHEBANG_FILES`."
msgstr "许多软件使用了不正确的脚本解释器路径，最常见的是 [.filename]#/usr/bin/perl# 和 [.filename]#/bin/bash#。shebangfix 宏会修正 `SHEBANG_REGEX`、`SHEBANG_GLOB` 或 `SHEBANG_FILES` 中列出的脚本里的 shebang 行。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2600
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`SHEBANG_REGEX`"
msgstr "`SHEBANG_REGEX`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2603
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Contains _one_ extended regular expressions, and is used with the `-iregex` "
"argument of man:find[1].  See crossref:uses[uses-shebangfix-ex-regex,"
"`USESshebangfix` with `SHEBANG_REGEX`]."
msgstr "包含 __一个__ 扩展正则表达式，并与 man:find[1] 的 `-iregex` 参数配合使用。请参阅 crossref:uses[uses-shebangfix-ex-regex,`USESshebangfix` 与 `SHEBANG_REGEX`]。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2604
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`SHEBANG_GLOB`"
msgstr "`SHEBANG_GLOB`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2607
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Contains a list of patterns used with the `-name` argument of man:find[1].  "
"See crossref:uses[uses-shebangfix-ex-glob,`USESshebangfix` with "
"`SHEBANG_GLOB`]."
msgstr "包含一个与 man:find[1] 的 `-name` 参数配合使用的模式列表。请参阅 crossref:uses[uses-shebangfix-ex-glob,`USESshebangfix` 与 `SHEBANG_GLOB`]。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2608
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`SHEBANG_FILES`"
msgstr "`SHEBANG_FILES`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2613
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Contains a list of files or man:sh[1] globs.  The shebangfix macro is run "
"from `${WRKSRC}`, so `SHEBANG_FILES` can contain paths that are relative to `"
"${WRKSRC}`.  It can also deal with absolute paths if files outside of `"
"${WRKSRC}` require patching.  See crossref:uses[uses-shebangfix-ex-files,"
"`USESshebangfix` with `SHEBANG_FILES`]."
msgstr "包含文件列表或 man:sh[1] 通配模式。shebangfix 宏从 `${WRKSRC}` 目录运行，因此 `SHEBANG_FILES` 可以包含相对于 `${WRKSRC}` 的路径。若需要修补 `${WRKSRC}` 之外的文件，它也可以处理绝对路径。请参阅 crossref:uses[uses-shebangfix-ex-files,`USESshebangfix` 与 `SHEBANG_FILES`]。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2615
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Currently Bash, Java, Ksh, Lua, Perl, PHP, Python, Ruby, Tcl, and Tk are "
"supported by default."
msgstr "默认支持 Bash、Java、Ksh、Lua、Perl、PHP、Python、Ruby、Tcl 和 Tk。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2617
#, fuzzy
msgid "There are three configuration variables:"
msgstr "有三个配置变量："

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2618
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`SHEBANG_LANG`"
msgstr "`SHEBANG_LANG`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2620
#, fuzzy
msgid "The list of supported interpreters."
msgstr "支持的解释器列表。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2621
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`_interp__CMD`"
msgstr "`_interp__CMD`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2624
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The path to the command interpreter on FreeBSD.  The default value is `"
"${LOCALBASE}/bin/_interp_`."
msgstr "FreeBSD 上命令解释器的路径。默认值为 `${LOCALBASE}/bin/_interp_`。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2625
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`_interp__OLD_CMD`"
msgstr "`_interp__OLD_CMD`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2629
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The list of wrong invocations of interpreters.  These are typically obsolete "
"paths, or paths used on other operating systems that are incorrect on "
"FreeBSD.  They will be replaced by the correct path in `_interp__CMD`."
msgstr "错误的解释器调用方式列表。这些通常是过时的路径，或是在其他操作系统上使用、但在 FreeBSD 上不正确的路径。它们会被替换为 `_interp__CMD` 中的正确路径。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2633
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These will _always_ be part of `_interp__OLD_CMD`: `\"/usr/bin/env _interp_"
"\" /bin/_interp_ /usr/bin/_interp_ /usr/local/bin/_interp_`."
msgstr "以下路径 __始终__ 属于 `_interp__OLD_CMD`：`\"/usr/bin/env _interp_\" /bin/_interp_ /usr/bin/_interp_ /usr/local/bin/_interp_`。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2640
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_interp__OLD_CMD` contain multiple values.  Any entry with spaces must be "
"quoted.  See crossref:uses[uses-shebangfix-ex-ksh,Specifying all the Paths "
"When Adding an Interpreter to `USESshebangfix`]."
msgstr "`_interp__OLD_CMD` 可以包含多个值。任何含有空格的条目都必须加引号。请参阅 crossref:uses[uses-shebangfix-ex-ksh,将解释器添加到 `USESshebangfix` 时指定所有路径]。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2646
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The fixing of shebangs is done during the `patch` phase.  If scripts are "
"created with incorrect shebangs during the `build` phase, the build process "
"(for example, the [.filename]#configure# script, or the [."
"filename]#Makefiles#) must be patched or given the right path (for example, "
"with `CONFIGURE_ENV`, `CONFIGURE_ARGS`, `MAKE_ENV`, or `MAKE_ARGS`) to "
"generate the right shebangs."
msgstr "shebang 的修正会在 `patch` 阶段进行。如果脚本在 `build` 阶段生成时带有错误的 shebang，则必须修补构建过程（例如 [.filename]#configure# 脚本或 [.filename]#Makefiles#），或为其提供正确的路径（例如通过 `CONFIGURE_ENV`、`CONFIGURE_ARGS`、`MAKE_ENV` 或 `MAKE_ARGS`），以生成正确的 shebang。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2648
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Correct paths for supported interpreters are available in `_interp__CMD`."
msgstr "受支持解释器的正确路径可在 `_interp__CMD` 中找到。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2653
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When used with crossref:uses[uses-python,`USES=python`], and the aim is only "
"to fix the shebangs but a dependency on Python itself is not wanted, use "
"`USES=python:env` instead."
msgstr "与 crossref:uses[uses-python,`USES=python`] 一起使用时，如果目的仅是修正 shebang，而不希望依赖 Python 本身，请改用 `USES=python:env`。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2656
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Adding Another Interpreter to `USES=shebangfix`"
msgstr "向 `USES=shebangfix` 添加另一个解释器"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2661
#, fuzzy
msgid "To add another interpreter, set `SHEBANG_LANG`.  For example:"
msgstr "要添加另一个解释器，请设置 `SHEBANG_LANG`。例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2665
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "SHEBANG_LANG=\tlua\n"
msgstr "SHEBANG_LANG=\tlua\n"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:2670
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Specifying all the Paths When Adding an Interpreter to `USES=shebangfix`"
msgstr "向 `USES=shebangfix` 添加解释器时指定所有路径"

#. type: delimited block = 4
