#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:3168
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Possible arguments: `app`, `data`, `doc`, `driver`, `font`, `lib`, `proto`, "
"`util`, `xserver` and (none) or one off `autotools` (default), `meson`"
msgstr "可用参数：`app`、`data`、`doc`、`driver`、`font`、`lib`、`proto`、`util`、`xserver`，以及（不指定）或以下其中一个：`autotools`（默认）、`meson`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:3172
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Provide support for building Xorg components.  It takes care of setting up "
"common dependencies and an appropriate configuration environment needed.  "
"This is intended only for Xorg components."
msgstr "为构建 Xorg 组件提供支持。它负责设置所需的通用依赖项和适当的配置环境。此功能仅适用于 Xorg 组件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:3174
#, fuzzy
msgid "The category has to match upstream categories."
msgstr "类别必须与上游类别相匹配。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/uses/_index.adoc:3177
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The second argument is the build system to use.  autotools is the default, "
"but meson is also supported."
msgstr "第二个参数是要使用的构建系统。默认使用 autotools，也支持 meson。"

